// ## 12. What ships when

Phase A (foundation): CODE_STYLE.oot, 2 templates, code_lint.oo, 6 proof-of-concept
rewrites, code_style_rollup.oot.

Phase B (5 worst): 5 files rewritten and split as needed.

Phase C (sweep): ~1500 files have the new style; linter passes.

Phase D (cross-cutting): RULES.oot, SCRIPTING.oot, BOOTSTRAP.oot, SPRINT.oot updated;
final rollup.

Phase E: Done. Marker: DINNER_2026-08-13.
